  "notes": "Huey (DuckDB-WASM pivot tool). Almost monochrome greyscale UI with no brand color; all 13px. Query state serialized as base64 in the URL hash. Axis wells hold pill chips (radius 15px) with tiny line icons for totals, move-to-other-axis, remove; chips can be dragged between axes. Pivot grid uses ditto marks (〃) instead of repeating parent labels, monospace right-aligned numbers, light grey header cells and a heavy separator before the Total row. Filter chip expands inline to a numbered Include list with checkboxes, and opens a dialog (Filter type select, LIKE pattern search, values list, Apply/Remove/Cancel) — not visible in capture. Attributes tab shows derivation tree (date fields: year, quarter, month…) with per-attribute add-to-rows/columns/cells/filter buttons."
